{"4537930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Field Recordings", "steam_appid": 4537930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Record the echoes of a fractured reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2130, reality began to break apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, ten years later, fragments of the world drift in isolation, connected by unstable fractures. Guided by a lonely AI from the abandoned Project Ariadne, you travel between these pockets, searching for survivors and signals left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can reality be fixed? Your task is to record what remains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting archipelago of fractured realities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Field Recorder to tune into echoes left in unstable spaces </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilise fragments and uncover hidden traces of those who came before </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet survivors adapting to life at the edge of collapse </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of Project Ariadne and the truth behind the fractures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each recording brings you closer to understanding what went wrong — and what still remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mac and Steam Deck support planned for release.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Record the echoes of a fractured reality.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2130, reality began to break apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, ten years later, fragments of the world drift in isolation, connected by unstable fractures. Guided by a lonely AI from the abandoned Project Ariadne, you travel between these pockets, searching for survivors and signals left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can reality be fixed? Your task is to record what remains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting archipelago of fractured realities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Field Recorder to tune into echoes left in unstable spaces </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilise fragments and uncover hidden traces of those who came before </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet survivors adapting to life at the edge of collapse </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of Project Ariadne and the truth behind the fractures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each recording brings you closer to understanding what went wrong — and what still remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mac and Steam Deck support planned for release.</p>", "short_description": "Field Recordings is an atmospheric sci-fi adventure set in the fragments of a collapsing reality. Guided by a lonely AI from the abandoned Project Ariadne, explore isolated pockets of the world and search for survivors. Use a Field Recorder to tune into echoes and uncover what remains.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537930/e3515190282ece950053c167dbb80eb812d21dfb/header.jpg?t=1774777359", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537930/5ad42bf51ceb81cd269947cb216301f79f76df24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774777359", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/453